{"branch":"신방화점","html":"<p class=\"kd-intro\">신방화점의 위치와 주변 교통편을 확인하세요.</p><div class=\"kd-map-slot\" data-kakao-src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-5e236dbc4467005d.html\" style=\"height:398px\"><p class=\"kd-map-pending\" role=\"status\">위치 지도를 준비하고 있습니다.</p><template><iframe class=\"kd-map-frame\" width=\"640\" height=\"398\" style=\"height:398px\" loading=\"lazy\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" title=\"신방화점 카카오맵 지도\" src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-5e236dbc4467005d.html\"></iframe></template></div><noscript><style>.kd-map-slot{display:none}</style><p class=\"kd-note\">위의 지도 이미지와 아래 주소를 기준으로 위치를 확인해 주세요.</p></noscript><p class=\"kd-address\"><strong>주소</strong><span>서울 강서구 방화대로 294 마곡더블유타워 505호</span></p><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 지하철</h3><ul class=\"kd-items\"><li><span class=\"kd-line\">수도권 9호선</span><span>신방화역</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-line\">수도권 9호선</span><span>공항시장역</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-line\">수도권 5호선</span><span>송정역</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-line\">수도권 9호선</span><span>마곡나루역</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-line\">공항철도선</span><span>마곡나루역</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 정류장</h3><ol class=\"kd-items\"><li><span class=\"kd-number\">1</span><span>신방화역5번출구</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">2</span><span>신방화역7번출구</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">3</span><span>신방화역6번출구.마곡엠밸리5단지</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">4</span><span>마곡엠밸리1단지</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">5</span><span>서울백영고등학교</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">6</span><span>마곡엠밸리3단지입구/신방화역4번출구.마곡중학교</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">7</span><span>서울백영고등학교</span></li></ol></div><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 버스</h3><dl class=\"kd-buses\"><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">간선</span></dt><dd><span>931</span><span>N64(심야)</span><span>651</span><span>86</span></dd></div><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">지선</span></dt><dd><span>6645</span><span>6648</span>